│                          │ is modularized into: seeding (deterministic multi-start candidates including an           │
│                          │ icosahedral configuration), constraint builders (vectorized pair distance functions), a   │
│                          │ solve stage, and a best-of restarts selection with final ratio-based renormalization.     │
│                          │ This directly attacks the true metric (squared ratio) instead of relying on luck, and     │
│                          │ targets the known reference ratio 1/4.1658 for 14 points in 3D.                           │
