│                          │ diameter pair together along their connecting axis — before the random-direction          │
│                          │ perturbations, since these are the highest-quality first-order moves for the exact ratio  │
│                          │ objective. This is cheap, monotone (strict improvements only), and increases the chance   │
│                          │ of squeezing out extra ratio beyond the current plateau at ~1.00.                         │
